COMPILATION OF: E46M2

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M2

   1 a 0000 E46M2:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] THE COMPOSITION CONTROL for E46M1: the same two
   4 a 0006      literals as TWO separate single-item file PUT statements. E46M1
   5 a 0006      minus E46M2 is what a second item costs. If the two objects
   6 a 0006      differ by anything but ONE attach and ONE ?QIOOP, a multi-item
   7 a 0006      list is NOT one attach plus a concatenation. */
   8 c 0006   dcl outf file;
   9 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M2OUT DAT');
  10 c 0023   put file(outf) list('A');
  11 c 003D   put file(outf) list('B');
  12 c 0057   close file(outf);
  13 a 005D end E46M2;

CODE SIZE = 0060
DATA AREA = 000B
FREE SYMS = 3887
END  COMPILATION
